{"id":"d8d81ce2a1b4e22b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/084_深推理_Deep_Inference.md","title":"084 深推理 Deep Inference","display":"084_深推理_Deep_Inference","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-公式语言\">1. 公式语言</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"top,\\quad bot,\\quad atm,\\quad natm,\\quad and,\\quad or.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[top,\\quad bot,\\quad atm,\\quad natm,\\quad and,\\quad or.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{DI}\">\\(Frm_{DI}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"top\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(top\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bot\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(bot\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"atm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(atm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in Prop\">\\(p\\in Prop\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"natm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(natm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(and(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(or(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本系统的目标差异为：局部规则可在公式上下文的任意深度处应用，证明是公式到公式的重写序列，而不是相继式树。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-变量、对偶与替换\">2. 变量、对偶与替换</h1>\n<p>原子函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_{DI}\">\\(At_{DI}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_{DI}(top)=At_{DI}(bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_{DI}(top)=At_{DI}(bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_{DI}(atm(p))=At_{DI}(natm(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_{DI}(atm(p))=At_{DI}(natm(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_{DI}(and(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_{DI}(and(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"At_{DI}(or(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[At_{DI}(or(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对偶函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual(top)=bot,\\quad dual(bot)=top,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual(top)=bot,\\quad dual(bot)=top,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual(atm(p))=natm(p),\\quad dual(natm(p))=atm(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual(atm(p))=natm(p),\\quad dual(natm(p))=atm(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual(and(A,B))=or(dual(A),dual(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual(and(A,B))=or(dual(A),dual(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"dual(or(A,B))=and(dual(A),dual(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[dual(or(A,B))=and(dual(A),dual(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_{DI}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{DI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_{DI}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{DI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换正扩张</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}:Frm_{DI}\\times Sub_{DI}\\to Frm_{DI}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}:Frm_{DI}\\times Sub_{DI}\\to Frm_{DI}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(top,\\sigma)=top,\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(bot,\\sigma)=bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(top,\\sigma)=top,\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(bot,\\sigma)=bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(atm(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(natm(p),\\sigma)=dual(\\sigma(p)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(atm(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(natm(p),\\sigma)=dual(\\sigma(p)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(and(A,B),\\sigma)=\nand(\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(A,\\sigma),\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(B,\\sigma)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(and(A,B),\\sigma)=\nand(\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(A,\\sigma),\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(B,\\sigma)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(or(A,B),\\sigma)=\nor(\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(A,\\sigma),\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(B,\\sigma)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(or(A,B),\\sigma)=\nor(\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(A,\\sigma),\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(B,\\sigma)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为公式字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-公式上下文\">3. 公式上下文</h1>\n<p>单洞公式上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FCtx_{DI}\">\\(FCtx_{DI}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"hole\\in FCtx_{DI}\">\\(hole\\in FCtx_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in FCtx_{DI}\">\\(C\\in FCtx_{DI}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(C,A)\">\\(and(C,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,C)\">\\(and(A,C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(C,A)\">\\(or(C,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,C)\">\\(or(A,C)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FCtx_{DI}\">\\(FCtx_{DI}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>填洞函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}:FCtx_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}\\to Frm_{DI}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}:FCtx_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}\\to Frm_{DI}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(hole,A)=A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}(hole,A)=A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(and(C,B),A)=and(Plug_{DI}(C,A),B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}(and(C,B),A)=and(Plug_{DI}(C,A),B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(and(B,C),A)=and(B,Plug_{DI}(C,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}(and(B,C),A)=and(B,Plug_{DI}(C,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(or(C,B),A)=or(Plug_{DI}(C,A),B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}(or(C,B),A)=or(Plug_{DI}(C,A),B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(or(B,C),A)=or(B,Plug_{DI}(C,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Plug_{DI}(or(B,C),A)=or(B,Plug_{DI}(C,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in FCtx_{DI}\">\\(C\\in FCtx_{DI}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{DI}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-深层结构同余\">4. 深层结构同余</h1>\n<p>同余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{DI}\">\\(\\equiv_{DI}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{DI}\">\\(Frm_{DI}\\)</span> 上满足下列条件的最小等价关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,B)\\equiv_{DI}and(B,A)\">\\(and(A,B)\\equiv_{DI}and(B,A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,B)\\equiv_{DI}or(B,A)\">\\(or(A,B)\\equiv_{DI}or(B,A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(and(A,B),C)\\equiv_{DI}and(A,and(B,C))\">\\(and(and(A,B),C)\\equiv_{DI}and(A,and(B,C))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(or(A,B),C)\\equiv_{DI}or(A,or(B,C))\">\\(or(or(A,B),C)\\equiv_{DI}or(A,or(B,C))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"and(A,top)\\equiv_{DI}A\">\\(and(A,top)\\equiv_{DI}A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"or(A,bot)\\equiv_{DI}A\">\\(or(A,bot)\\equiv_{DI}A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{DI}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{DI}B\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Plug_{DI}(C,A)\\equiv_{DI}Plug_{DI}(C,B)\">\\(Plug_{DI}(C,A)\\equiv_{DI}Plug_{DI}(C,B)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"5.-上行与下行局部规则\">5. 上行与下行局部规则</h1>\n<p>每个上下文闭包规则都是公式到公式的二元关系：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ai\\downarrow},Rule_{ai\\uparrow},Rule_s,\nRule_m,Rule_w^{DI},Rule_c^{DI}\n\\subseteq Frm_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{ai\\downarrow},Rule_{ai\\uparrow},Rule_s,\nRule_m,Rule_w^{DI},Rule_c^{DI}\n\\subseteq Frm_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子相互作用下行规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ai\\downarrow}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,top),Plug_{DI}(C,or(atm(p),natm(p)))):C\\in FCtx_{DI},p\\in Prop\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{ai\\downarrow}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,top),Plug_{DI}(C,or(atm(p),natm(p)))):C\\in FCtx_{DI},p\\in Prop\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子相互作用上行规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{ai\\uparrow}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(atm(p),natm(p))),Plug_{DI}(C,bot)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},p\\in Prop\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{ai\\uparrow}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(atm(p),natm(p))),Plug_{DI}(C,bot)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},p\\in Prop\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>开关规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{s}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(A,or(B,D))),Plug_{DI}(C,or(and(A,B),D))):\nC\\in FCtx_{DI},\\ A,B,D\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{s}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(A,or(B,D))),Plug_{DI}(C,or(and(A,B),D))):\nC\\in FCtx_{DI},\\ A,B,D\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-中介、弱化与收缩\">6. 中介、弱化与收缩</h1>\n<p>中介规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{m}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(or(A,B),or(D,E))),Plug_{DI}(C,or(and(A,D),and(B,E)))):\nC\\in FCtx_{DI},\\ A,B,D,E\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{m}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,and(or(A,B),or(D,E))),Plug_{DI}(C,or(and(A,D),and(B,E)))):\nC\\in FCtx_{DI},\\ A,B,D,E\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>弱化规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_w^{DI}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,bot),Plug_{DI}(C,A)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},A\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_w^{DI}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,bot),Plug_{DI}(C,A)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},A\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>收缩规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_c^{DI}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,or(A,A)),Plug_{DI}(C,A)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},A\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_c^{DI}\n=\n\\{(Plug_{DI}(C,or(A,A)),Plug_{DI}(C,A)):C\\in FCtx_{DI},A\\in Frm_{DI}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{DI}\n=\nRule_{ai\\downarrow}\n\\cup\nRule_{ai\\uparrow}\n\\cup\nRule_s\n\\cup\nRule_m\n\\cup\nRule_w^{DI}\n\\cup\nRule_c^{DI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{DI}\n=\nRule_{ai\\downarrow}\n\\cup\nRule_{ai\\uparrow}\n\\cup\nRule_s\n\\cup\nRule_m\n\\cup\nRule_w^{DI}\n\\cup\nRule_c^{DI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{DI}\\subseteq Frm_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{DI}\\subseteq Frm_{DI}\\times Frm_{DI}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>初始公式对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Init_{DI}=\\{top\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Init_{DI}=\\{top\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-深推理证明\">7. 深推理证明</h1>\n<p>深推理证明是非空有限公式序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\((A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，且每个相邻对属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_{DI}\">\\(Rule_{DI}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{DI}\">\\(\\equiv_{DI}\\)</span>。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的证明要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0=A\">\\(A_0=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=B\">\\(A_{m-1}=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI}(A,B,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI}(A,B,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_{DI}\n\\wedge\n\\pi(0)=A\n\\wedge\n\\pi(m-1)=B\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\bigl((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{DI}\\vee \\pi(i)\\equiv_{DI}\\pi(i+1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_{DI}\n\\wedge\n\\pi(0)=A\n\\wedge\n\\pi(m-1)=B\n\\wedge\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\bigl((\\pi(i),\\pi(i+1))\\in Rule_{DI}\\vee \\pi(i)\\equiv_{DI}\\pi(i+1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可导关系\">8. 可导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash_{DI}B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\vdash_{DI}B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI}(A,B,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI}(A,B,\\pi)\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{DI}B\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in Init_{DI}\\ A\\vdash_{DI}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{DI}B\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in Init_{DI}\\ A\\vdash_{DI}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标差异\">9. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{DI}\n=\n(FCtx_{DI},Plug_{DI},Rule_{ai\\downarrow},Rule_{ai\\uparrow},\nRule_s,Rule_m,Rule_w^{DI},Rule_c^{DI},\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI},\\vdash_{DI}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{DI}\n=\n(FCtx_{DI},Plug_{DI},Rule_{ai\\downarrow},Rule_{ai\\uparrow},\nRule_s,Rule_m,Rule_w^{DI},Rule_c^{DI},\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI},\\vdash_{DI}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有局部规则均在单洞公式上下文中闭包，证明对象是公式到公式的有限深层重写序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个形式系统\">10. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DeepInference}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{DI},\nAt_{DI},\ndual,\nSub_{DI},\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI},\nFCtx_{DI},\nPlug_{DI},\n\\equiv_{DI},\nRule_{ai\\downarrow},\nRule_{ai\\uparrow},\nRule_s,\nRule_m,\nRule_w^{DI},\nRule_c^{DI},\nRule_{DI},\nInit_{DI},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI},\n\\vdash_{DI},\n\\Delta_{DI}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DeepInference}\n=\n\\bigl(\nProp,\nFrm_{DI},\nAt_{DI},\ndual,\nSub_{DI},\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI},\nFCtx_{DI},\nPlug_{DI},\n\\equiv_{DI},\nRule_{ai\\downarrow},\nRule_{ai\\uparrow},\nRule_s,\nRule_m,\nRule_w^{DI},\nRule_c^{DI},\nRule_{DI},\nInit_{DI},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{DI},\n\\vdash_{DI},\n\\Delta_{DI}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含公式内部任意深度位置的局部重写、上下文填洞和有限深推理证明；不含相继式边、显示结构或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-公式语言","text":"1. 公式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-变量、对偶与替换","text":"2. 变量、对偶与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-公式上下文","text":"3. 公式上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-深层结构同余","text":"4. 深层结构同余","level":1},{"id":"5.-上行与下行局部规则","text":"5. 上行与下行局部规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-中介、弱化与收缩","text":"6. 中介、弱化与收缩","level":1},{"id":"7.-深推理证明","text":"7. 深推理证明","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导关系","text":"8. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标差异","text":"9. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个形式系统","text":"10. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Prop=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"top,\\quad bot,\\quad atm,\\quad natm,\\quad and,\\quad or.","display":true},{"tex":"Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"top\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"bot\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"atm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in Prop","display":false},{"tex":"natm(p)\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"and(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"or(A,B)\\in Frm_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"At_{DI}","display":false},{"tex":"At_{DI}(top)=At_{DI}(bot)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"At_{DI}(atm(p))=At_{DI}(natm(p))=\\{p\\},","display":true},{"tex":"At_{DI}(and(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"At_{DI}(or(A,B))=At_{DI}(A)\\cup At_{DI}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"dual(top)=bot,\\quad dual(bot)=top,","display":true},{"tex":"dual(atm(p))=natm(p),\\quad dual(natm(p))=atm(p),","display":true},{"tex":"dual(and(A,B))=or(dual(A),dual(B)),","display":true},{"tex":"dual(or(A,B))=and(dual(A),dual(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_{DI}=\\{\\sigma:Prop\\to Frm_{DI}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}:Frm_{DI}\\times Sub_{DI}\\to Frm_{DI}","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(top,\\sigma)=top,\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(bot,\\sigma)=bot,","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(atm(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(natm(p),\\sigma)=dual(\\sigma(p)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(and(A,B),\\sigma)=\nand(\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(A,\\sigma),\\widehat\\sigma_{DI}(B,\